Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=96}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.77,0:01:59.77,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Velitsu! Hankala kaivaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.77,0:02:01.01,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Niin, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:03.21,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,{\q2}Onhan saari paljolti puunjuurten päällä.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.71,0:02:07.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Armoa! Älkää haudatko meitä!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.31,0:02:09.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me tehdään mitä vain,\Nkunhan säästätte henkemme!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.85,0:02:13.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me vain toteltiin kapteenia!\NSitä Blackin kurjimusta...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.19,0:02:18.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mie kuulkaas ajattelin...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.92,0:02:23.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,että Olkihatun toveriksi päästyämme...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.86,0:02:26.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,voitaisiin sisältäpäin...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.17,0:02:33.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,listiä koko sakki vapaasti.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.11,0:02:37.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drip!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:39.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hei, lopeta! Sehän kuolee!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.91,0:02:42.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onko sullakin pirunmarjavoimat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:44.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K-Käskin lopettaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.62,0:02:47.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jes! Osuipas...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.82,0:02:53.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Häh? Mitä hittoa... Logia-tyyppikö?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.23,0:02:57.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ja kuinkas sitten kävikään!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.90,0:03:03.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kyllä kahdessa vuodessa\Nnaama ja kroppa ehtii muuttua, ajattelin...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.23,0:03:05.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olkihattu-piraatti...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.10,0:03:06.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mutta eipä mitään!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.90,0:03:09.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kyseessä oli vain puijari!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.01,0:03:12.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Salliiko Jumala tällaista, Coribou?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.31,0:03:13.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaivan, kaivan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.81,0:03:15.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jetsulleen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.21,0:03:17.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haudataan kaikki tyynni!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.01,0:03:19.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Voi jumalat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.45,0:03:23.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Myö hautaamme joka iikan\Nnäistä tyhmyreistä!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.49,0:03:27.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lopettakaa! Älkää tappako meitä!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.19,0:03:33.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mutta näin ikiomin silmin myös\Naidon Olkihattu-Luffyn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:39.64,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,{\q2}Kerroinhan jo. Ei siinä tilanteessa voinut muuta.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:43.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eteen asettui "Haades" Rayleigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.21,0:03:45.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mies pysäytti setä Kizarunkin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.34,0:03:47.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mitä meidän muka pitäisi tehdä?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.95,0:03:55.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Aukiolta pääsivät livahtamaan Caribou-veljekset\Njoukkoineen, ja osa valeolkihatuista.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.65,0:04:02.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Nappasimme kaikki muut, mutta aidot\NOlkihatut vaurioittivat pahasti kahta pasifistaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.86,0:04:06.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Kyllä, prototyyppejä, jotka kaksi\Nvuotta sitten panivat heidät ahtaalle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:09.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pasifistojen voimat ei ole muuttuneet...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:11.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,vaan sen {\i1}porukan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:16.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Piileskelyaikanaan he ovat\Nkehittyneet rajusti!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:22.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Varmistakaa, että päämaja\NUudessa Maailmassa tajuaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.15,0:04:27.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olkihatun sakki on taas iskukykyinen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.09,0:04:33.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lähtö kävi äkkiä.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.26,0:04:42.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pikku Monkey ja muut olivat varttuneet...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.57,0:04:44.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Katselit siis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:46.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Toki, olenhan fani.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.67,0:04:52.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ray... Muistelitko kenties jotain?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:54.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.45,0:04:57.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Itse asiassa...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:04.69,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hoi! Komea pursi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.69,0:05:06.42,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kunhan pöllin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.42,0:05:08.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Asun tällä, kun taloni paloi poroksi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.76,0:05:11.26,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahaa. Mikä on nimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.26,0:05:12.40,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:15.00,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Mä olen Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:18.07,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kohtalo toi meidät yhteen, Rayleigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.07,0:05:19.77,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kohtalo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.77,0:05:23.21,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Keikautetaanko yhdessä\Nmaailma ylösalaisin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:24.71,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Häh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.71,0:05:26.18,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Maailma?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.21,0:05:29.18,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Mikä luulet olevasi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.65,0:05:31.01,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ala kalppia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.88,0:05:36.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ehkä tässä maailmassa\Nei olekaan sattumia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.02,0:05:39.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Tapahtumat ja siteet muodostavat kuvioita,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:43.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kuin kaikki olisi jo ennalta saneltua.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:46.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oli miten oli, Luffysta on tullut mies,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:50.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,jolle tuo hattu sopii aina vain paremmin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.30,0:05:54.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elämällä saattaa olla vielä jotain\Nhauskaa tarjottavaa...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.67,0:05:58.11,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Pinta on jo noin kaukana.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.11,0:05:59.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mitkä näkymät!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.91,0:06:03.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sukellusveneeseen ei saisi\Nnäin leveää ikkunaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.71,0:06:06.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vajoamme aina vian syvemmälle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:09.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onko ihan varma, että vesi ei tule sisälle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:13.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ihmismaailma tuntuu jotenkin\Nkaukaiselta... Jännittää!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:18.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,P-Päästäänkö vielä takaisin maan päälle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.13,0:06:21.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E-Ei sillä että pelkäisin...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.63,0:06:26.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meri on tosi kaunis...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:36.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vilkaiskaapa vierellemme!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.35,0:06:41.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Puita... Ei kun juuria!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.52,0:06:46.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tosiaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.19,0:06:50.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kun asiaa ajattelee, koko Sabaodyhan\Non iso mangrovemetsä...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:53.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luonto näyttää mahtinsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.50,0:06:56.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Melkein poksahtavat silmät ulos kallosta!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:57.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, mutta eihän minulla niitä ole.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.07,0:07:01.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mä näin jo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:03.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Väärällä laivalla!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.11,0:07:05.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pää kii ja anna toisten vaikuttua!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.18,0:07:09.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Juuret ulottuvat pohjaan saakka...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.61,0:07:13.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tämä valtavuus vetää sanattomaksi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.49,0:07:21.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jo riitti minulle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.16,0:07:22.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hei, Chopper...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.63,0:07:24.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Puun takana on jotain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.66,0:07:25.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Täh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.46,0:07:29.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vau, se on iso!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.37,0:07:31.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tosi jänskää!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.34,0:07:33.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seikkailu meren alla!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:34.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuin näkisi unta!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.94,0:07:37.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oho! Kaloja!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:38.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Melkein saan kiinni..!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:42.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Toikin näyttää makoisalta.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:46.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nyt loppuu tuollainen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:48.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Entä jos kupla puhkeaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.89,0:07:50.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saatte köniin jos teette noin vielä!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.85,0:07:56.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-neiti, kertokaa, miten pitää toimia,\Nennen kuin nuo hölmöävät jotain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.89,0:07:58.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olet oikeassa, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.76,0:08:01.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herra Rayleigh kirjoitti ohjeet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:03.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No niin, kaikki! Selitän...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.20,0:08:04.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Liikkui!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.57,0:08:06.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Livekaunotar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.30,0:08:07.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sanji!\N– Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.87,0:08:09.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hajoaa! Hajoaa! Hajoaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.27,0:08:11.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Miten purskauksesta noin voi lentää?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:15.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Täh?!\N– Täh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.31,0:08:17.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sanji putkahti mereen!\N– Sanji putkahti mereen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:18.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiehtovaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.72,0:08:26.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Kupla ei hajoa huolimatta näin syvällä\Nveden alla vallitsevasta valtavasta paineesta,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.59,0:08:30.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,mutta asiat voivat kulkea\Nsen läpi tuosta noin vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:32.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.90,0:08:35.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tule takaisin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.97,0:08:38.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meri vie voimat...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.17,0:08:41.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Tsemppiä!\N– Tsemppiä!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.58,0:08:55.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mikä sinua vaivaa, Sanji?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.75,0:08:58.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuin et enää kestäisi naisia!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.99,0:09:00.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ei se ole sinunlaistasi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.42,0:09:01.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surullista...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.39,0:09:06.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mitä Sanji, naisrakas ystävämme,\Non näiden vuosien aikana kokenut...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.30,0:09:13.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ja jos tällä menolla kohtaamme\Nmerenneitoja, hän vielä vuotaa kuiviin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.90,0:09:16.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,En voi olla kuin huolissani.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.57,0:09:19.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Täytyy saada lisää verta Nereidisaarella...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.94,0:09:24.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onkohan nereidien ja merenmiesten\Nveri kuin ihmisillä?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.21,0:09:28.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sunnyn{\i0} päällyste toimii samalla tavalla
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.52,0:09:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kuten Sabaodyn kuplat,\Nkuten juuri näimme. Niinkö?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:36.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Älä sä vain viileänä analysoi kuplia!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.69,0:09:38.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Robin's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.23,0:09:41.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Basically, they're the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:46.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It stretches to a certain point and\Nbeyond that, it allows things to get through. - CR}It stretches to a certain point and beyond that, it allows things to get through.{Z - needs the contrasting contraction "but" and a comma before it}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:51.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,383,1,\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}Which means if we fire a gun or a cannon\Nat a creature that attacks us,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:52.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the bubble won't break.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:53.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.08,0:09:57.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Then, on what occasion will it break instead? - CR}Then on what occasion would it break?{Z - "instead" is redundant, and "would" clarifies the speculative nature of the line}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.61,0:10:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As you can imagine, when there are\Ntoo many holes at once, it'll break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.15,0:10:07.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For example, if we are bitten\Nby a sea king's fangs, it'll be trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.23,0:10:13.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,548)}– It's coming from behind!\N– It's coming from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.73,0:10:15.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're fighting... We're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:21.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or if the ship itself breaks up\Nby crashing into a rock or a trench,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.14,0:10:27.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the broken mast or planking will break\Nthe bubble, and that also spells danger.{Z - comma was missing}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:30.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we have to be careful\Nwith creatures and obstacles in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.78,0:10:33.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as we don't do anything\Nfoolish from inside, it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:37.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see! It's tougher than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:39.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.22,0:10:43.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{70% of ships that head for the Fishman Island... - OG}of the ships that head\Nfor Fishman Island, 70% of them...{Gab, no numeral at start}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.19,0:10:46.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,end up sinking. So be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:49.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What's gonna happen?!\N– What's gonna happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.67,0:10:54.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With my Gatling, I can catch\Na whole school of fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.30,0:10:57.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then let's see which of us can catch more fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.41,0:11:02.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weren't you guys listening\Nto what Nami said?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.41,0:11:04.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Too many holes" is no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.71,0:11:08.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't ever try it again or I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.12,0:11:09.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.39,0:11:15.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Hachi said he'd show us the way to Fishman Island,\Nso I thought it was gonna be a safe trip!{Z - comma was missing}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.93,0:11:16.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!{Z - comma was missing}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.76,0:11:19.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They gave me a lot of lunches!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.90,0:11:22.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since Sanji is sick, let's eat these, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.80,0:11:25.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so starved!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.57,0:11:28.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My bones are starved!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.71,0:11:32.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, the ship is gonna be stable for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.71,0:11:35.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't we have to do anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:36.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:39.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We just have to ride\Nthis big sea current for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.98,0:11:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, we can continue on\Nlike this for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.35,0:11:46.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have much to do until later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.52,0:11:49.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then we have a little time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.76,0:11:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something that\NI have to tell you all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.43,0:11:56.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– The robot's secrets?!\N– The robot's secrets?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.63,0:11:59.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have more secrets?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.10,0:12:01.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What can you transform into?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.00,0:12:03.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or you have a secret weapon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:05.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell us, robot brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.44,0:12:09.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\fs95\c&H2C3AA7&\fad(150,150)}Super {\c&H9797D4&\alpha&HFF&}Armor{\c&HC2B698&}ed {\c&HE1D672&}Me!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.98,0:12:09.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\fs95\c&H2C3AA7&\fad(150,150)\alpha&HFF&}Super {\c&H9797D4&\alpha&H00&\4a&H78&}Armor{\c&HC2B698&}ed {\c&HE1D672&\alpha&HFF&}Me!
Dialogue: 2,0:12:08.31,0:12:09.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\fs95\c&H2C3AA7&\fad(150,150)\alpha&HFF&}Super {\c&H9797D4&}Armor{\c&HC2B698&}ed {\c&HE1D672&\alpha&H00&\4a&H78&}Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.68,0:12:16.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I'm afraid...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:18.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\b1}I'm afraid it's not about that-robo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.96,0:12:21.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Wow, cool! He speaks Robotese!\N– Wow, cool! He speaks Robotese!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:26.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is what I wanna tell you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.76,0:12:29.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and eat while you're listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hachi told us that he would show us\Nthe way to Fishman Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:40.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{[/q2]but he got severely injured at Sabaody\Nand he's under medical care at Fishman Island. - CR}{\q2}but he was severely injured at Sabaody\Nand placed under medical care at Fishman Island.{Z - fixed the run-on sentence}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.31,0:12:43.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He got injured for the same reason as Duval.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.21,0:12:48.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He had been protecting the {\i1}Thousand Sunny{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.79,0:12:52.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{[/q2]Around a year ago, the Marines found out about\Nthe[/i1]Sunny[/i0]and those two both faced fierce battles and were taken out of commission. - CR}{\q2}When the Marines found out\Nabout the {\i1}Sunny{\i0} two years ago,{Z - fixed the run-on}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.49,0:12:56.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{[/q2]Around a year ago, the Marines found out about\Nthe[/i1]Sunny[/i0]and those two both faced fierce battles and were taken out of commission. - CR}those two faced fierce battles\Nbut were taken out of commission.{Z - fixed the run-on}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.53,0:12:57.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.59,0:13:01.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then how did the ship\Nremain undamaged after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.67,0:13:04.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There was someone else who fought for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.47,0:13:06.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There was someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.87,0:13:12.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's the one who separated us two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.58,0:13:18.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(3350,0,1,\c&H000000&)}The big Warlord: Bartholomew Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.82,0:13:25.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe my eyes\Nwhen I got to the {\i1}Sunny{\i0} a few days ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:31.83,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.43,0:13:35.50,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.73,0:13:38.80,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Mission accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.59,0:13:58.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There isn't even a scratch on the {\i1}Sunny{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.46,0:14:02.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And Rayleigh told me later...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.73,0:14:05.73,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I work for the Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.73,0:14:09.27,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Since I have a connection with them,\NI wanna let them get away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.63,0:14:13.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think you guys half expected that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:16.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He saved our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.54,0:14:21.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And after we vanished from the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.51,0:14:25.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuma{-san} visited Rayleigh and told him...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.25,0:14:26.92,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,515,1,\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.02,0:14:29.69,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,don't have much time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.02,0:14:34.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what made him obey the Marines,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.22,0:14:39.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{[/q2]but he agreed to be a guinea pig and let his body\Nbe modified into a cyborg piece by piece - CR}{\q2}but he agreed to be a guinea pig and let his body\Nbe modified into a cyborg piece by piece.{Z - ended the sentence to fix the run-on}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.76,0:14:45.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{and he somehow lost his personality\Nbefore the Summit War. - CR}He somehow lost his personality\Nbefore the Summit War.{Z - started a new sentence to fix a run-on}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:52.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I don't think he could guess what\Neach of us would do after we get separated!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.78,0:14:56.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even so, he waited for us\Nat the ship without his personality?{Z - comma was missing}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.51,0:15:00.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{He made Dr. Vegapunk, who modified him... - CR}He made Dr. Vegapunk, who modified him,{Z - comma instead of ellipsis to help connect the thoughts}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.85,0:15:05.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,agree to program a mission into his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}"Defend the pirate ship until the day that\None of the Straw Hats comes back to the ship."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.36,0:15:15.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why, for the past two years,\Nwithout his own memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.47,0:15:21.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he had been carrying out his own orders,\Nas a human weapon, waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.01,0:15:25.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.64,0:15:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did he do such a thing for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:30.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Terms like "connection," "Revolutionary Army,"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:35.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,remind me about Luffy's father,\Nthe leader of the Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.25,0:15:42.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know my father that well,\Nbut that bear-like guy was a good guy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.29,0:15:44.49,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuma...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.49,0:15:54.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is no mistake that he's the one\Nwho gave us the past two worthwhile years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:16:01.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't even ask him why he did it,\Nbut just remember that.{Z - was missing the comma}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:08.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew Kuma turned out\Nto be one of our greatest allies.
Comment: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:05.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew Kuma turned out to be one of our greatest allies.
Comment: 0,0:16:05.82,0:16:08.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew Kuma turned out to be one of our greatest allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.38,0:16:12.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But even if we meet him again,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.56,0:16:15.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuma is now a heartless human weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.19,0:16:17.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's all I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.69,0:16:23.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{I appreciate what he did but there are still some mysteries.\NI hope we can find out his motive one day. - CR}I'm grateful, but there are still some mysteries.\NI hope we can find out his motive one day.{Gab/Z - concatenated and tightened for CPS}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.43,0:16:24.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Ally"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.77,0:16:26.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, you woke up, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:29.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat lunch! It's from the Isle of Women!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.57,0:16:31.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isle of Women?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.77,0:16:34.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that Kuma guy really an ally?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:37.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize where I was\Nfor the past two years?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:42.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What kind of training were you doing\Nat the dream island full of women, Luffy? - CR}What kind of training were you doing\Nat a dream island full of women, Luffy?{Z - if not the epithet, this needed to be the indefinite article "a", not definite "the"}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.59,0:16:44.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Whoa, whoa, Sanji-san, - OG}Now, now, Sanji.{Gab}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.75,0:16:50.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you've been through, but let's enjoy the voyage now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.09,0:16:51.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna sing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.49,0:16:54.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to cheer me up! I feel pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.23,0:16:57.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brother, there he is. Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.30,0:17:01.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can see that, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.94,0:17:06.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna join them this time for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.14,0:17:08.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How deeply are we submerged now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.55,0:17:12.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's getting darker and darker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.85,0:17:17.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{We went through the euphotic zone\Nand we're at the bottom of the twilight zone. - CR}We went through the euphotic zone,\Nand we're at the bottom of the twilight zone.{Z - comma was missing}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.99,0:17:20.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must be more than\Na thousand meters below.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.99,0:17:22.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's really quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.23,0:17:25.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It feels different from submersibles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.50,0:17:28.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It feels like flying in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.23,0:17:30.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whale! There is a whale!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.17,0:17:32.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Laboon! Laboon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.07,0:17:34.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, that's old man Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.24,0:17:40.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something\Nat six o'clock! Is it a creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.74,0:17:41.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:44.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you guys all ready?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.98,0:17:46.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.38,0:17:47.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes, yes!\N– Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:50.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The target is right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.62,0:17:56.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's easier to just destroy their ship\Nand let it be swallowed by the sea,{Z - comma at the end was missing}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.93,0:18:01.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but that's no good because\Nthey won't know who did it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.93,0:18:09.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We gotta cut their heads off and bring them back\Nto show the world what Caribou is capable of!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.81,0:18:10.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes!\N– Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.17,0:18:13.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not ready to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.64,0:18:15.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a complete surprise attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.41,0:18:18.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't make a mistake, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.15,0:18:19.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes!\N– Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.62,0:18:21.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.65,0:18:25.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! There is a ship\Nkind of thing coming from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.69,0:18:26.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.59,0:18:27.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.26,0:18:28.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's coming toward us!{Z - "towards" --> "toward" per writing guide}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.19,0:18:30.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:39.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a pirate ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.87,0:18:41.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're pushing against us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.97,0:18:45.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go away! The bubble is gonna pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.68,0:18:54.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! They're gonna come through the bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.52,0:18:56.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.52,0:19:00.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.69,0:19:02.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hard to port!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.73,0:19:11.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, sea cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.94,0:19:16.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're coming after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.24,0:19:16.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That sounds so familiar... - OG}That sound...{Gab, lit. "that voice/sound" (この声), unlocalized for cps}{Z - use "sound" not "noise" since she's recognizing the sound of Momoo, and ellipsis instead of en dash since it's a naturally trailing thought even without the bump on the ship}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:19.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're so persistent!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.04,0:19:22.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do they want from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.35,0:19:27.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.72,0:19:29.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bubble is gonna pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.55,0:19:31.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're doing great, sea cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.42,0:19:32.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes!\N– Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.49,0:19:34.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are they gonna come aboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.79,0:19:34.86,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Sea cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.13,0:19:37.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute! That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.33,0:19:43.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bubbles are joined!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.17,0:19:44.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brother, now is the chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.97,0:19:46.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:48.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Should we do it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.37,0:19:49.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes!\N– Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.61,0:19:51.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.24,0:19:53.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You're Momoo of the Arlong Pirates, aren't you? - OG}Aren't you Momoo of the Arlong Pirates?{Gab, little change for cps}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:56.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.25,0:19:57.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.61,0:19:59.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was there at the Arlong Park!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.55,0:20:03.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.02,0:20:04.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doesn't he look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.89,0:20:05.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.02,0:20:09.26,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,518,1,\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}Die, damn you!{Arlong 02 - 10:21}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.26,0:20:12.03,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.83,0:20:17.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's board their ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.13,0:20:17.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes!\N– Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.37,0:20:22.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! He's coming through the bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.14,0:20:23.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, somebody's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.94,0:20:25.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.01,0:20:30.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.51,0:20:32.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.22,0:20:33.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes!\N– Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.02,0:20:41.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While they're dumbfounded,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.32,0:20:44.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.56,0:20:47.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.40,0:20:50.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.43,0:20:53.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys, follow my lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.37,0:20:59.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?!\N– What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.28,0:21:00.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, sea cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.81,0:21:02.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, sea cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.18,0:21:05.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no, we left Captain Caribou on that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:07.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.72,0:21:13.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, by way of greeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:18.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,fire the gatling gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.03,0:21:25.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kill all the Straw Hats and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.41,0:21:29.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.82,0:21:45.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! Don't throw me out into the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.29,0:21:51.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's something you shouldn't do!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.73,0:21:55.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have to value people's life!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The gods... The gods are watching\Nover you! Don't you think so?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.64,0:22:03.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're being inconsistent!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.04,0:22:06.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weren't you gonna fire\Na gatling gun and kill us all?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.08,0:22:08.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, that was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.91,0:22:11.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was just a play on words.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.75,0:22:13.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That wasn't playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.32,0:22:15.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.18,0:22:17.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must be the captain of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.82,0:22:19.96,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Roronoa Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.76,0:22:24.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way! I'm not a captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.86,0:22:26.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.50,0:22:30.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was forced to be a slave for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.60,0:22:33.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sick of being on that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.50,0:22:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! This is great!{Z - comma was missing after "Oh"}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.20,0:22:38.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can I stay on this ship for a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.57,0:22:39.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.78,0:22:43.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, he is kind of pathetic...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.45,0:22:46.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way! He just made it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.12,0:22:48.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! He just made it up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.78,0:22:52.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, where did you find the sea cow\Nwho was drawing your ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.66,0:22:54.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.06,0:22:57.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.99,0:22:59.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Cutie-san! - OG}one fine cutie!{Gab}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.33,0:23:02.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the Cat Burglar.{Z - "the Cat Burglar" is her epithet and needs to be capitalized}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.47,0:23:07.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,252)}Stop looking at our navigator like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.50,0:23:10.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami{-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.07,0:23:13.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're safe... now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.38,0:23:16.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's getting to be a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.05,0:23:20.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just caught that sea monster somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.62,0:23:26.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Experienced people\Nhave those animals pull their ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.79,0:23:28.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.06,0:23:30.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.29,0:23:33.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop, sea cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.43,0:23:34.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.06,0:23:38.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brother! I'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.14,0:23:42.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna find a sea monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.07,0:23:43.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.47,0:23:45.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:50.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's start his rehabilitation\Nwith some less stimulating pics.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.18,0:23:51.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.81,0:23:54.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The direction we're heading is slightly off from where log pose is pointing. - OG}We're not exactly heading\Nwhere the log pose is pointing.{Gab}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.95,0:23:56.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.09,0:24:00.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The right course should be\Nsouthwest of where it's pointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.52,0:24:05.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's faster to go straight.\NWhy should we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.39,0:24:09.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you go straight, you'd be\Ntaken away by the sea current
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.93,0:24:13.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{and get stuck by an undersea mountain or volcano. - OG}and get stuck by a volcano\Nor an undersea mountain.{Gab, better line break}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.37,0:24:15.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Volcano!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.57,0:24:17.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's scary to be in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.04,0:24:22.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I thought the sea currents\Nin the Grand Line were volatile.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.11,0:24:24.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is there any stable current?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.85,0:24:26.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.58,0:24:28.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.05,0:24:29.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.39,0:24:34.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone! It's gonna get colder from\Nhere on out, so wear a coat or something.{Z - comma was missing after "out"}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.39,0:24:38.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's getting chilly. I can feel it on my skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.46,0:24:40.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.60,0:24:43.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a skeleton, so you don't have skin.{Z - comma was missing after "skeleton"}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.57,0:24:46.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper{-san}...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.24,0:24:48.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.40,0:24:51.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't steal my line...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.11,0:24:54.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are we going somewhere cold?\NNot the deep sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.34,0:24:57.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you know that the water\Nin the deep sea is cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.91,0:25:01.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like in a bathtub, hot water goes up\Nand cold water goes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.55,0:25:04.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah? I'm not a big fan\Nof baths so I wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.39,0:25:05.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.96,0:25:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the sea is the same as a bathtub,\Nit's gonna get colder as you go deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.23,0:25:13.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The temperature isn't the only difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.03,0:25:16.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're still depressed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.17,0:25:17.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the deep layer of the sea...
Dialogue: 3,0:25:18.30,0:25:24.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}there are giant currents called deep currents\Nthat you don't get to see very often.
Dialogue: 3,0:25:24.91,0:25:29.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Those currents flow totally\Nindependently from surface currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.98,0:25:33.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are currents under currents?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.05,0:25:34.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You know many things! - OG}You know a lot!{Gab}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.25,0:25:37.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because I'm really old!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.32,0:25:41.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All currents are connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.72,0:25:44.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One current flows eastward,\Nand the other one flows westward.{Z - comma missing after "eastward"}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.93,0:25:48.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They could also flow upward or downward.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.20,0:25:50.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like a giant dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.77,0:25:55.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deep currents flow really slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.30,0:26:01.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once they flow to the deep sea,\Nit takes 2,000 years...{Z - higher numerals (except large round numbers in the millions and up which have their own rules) don't get spelled out per the writing guide}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.18,0:26:04.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,until they flow upward to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.01,0:26:05.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Two thousand years?!\N– Two thousand years?!{Z - doubled up}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.61,0:26:06.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.25,0:26:14.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}That's why there are a number of myths\Nabout the dark and undiscovered deep currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.86,0:26:16.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.26,0:26:17.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.39,0:26:19.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spirits of the dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.96,0:26:21.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.06,0:26:23.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are ghosts in the deep sea?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.00,0:26:25.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Really? I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.30,0:26:26.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.67,0:26:28.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ghosts...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.80,0:26:30.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.57,0:26:35.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we're gonna get on a downward flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.88,0:26:40.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's how we get to the deep sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.15,0:26:45.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{So there are wonderful currents... - OG}– So there's mystery currents...\N– So there's mystery currents...{Gab, matching the gag in RM 01 - 07:59}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.12,0:26:47.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys didn't understand a bit, did you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.23,0:26:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wanna sing, Nami{-san}?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.76,0:26:52.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.73,0:26:58.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.53,0:27:00.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, I see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.37,0:27:01.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.37,0:27:03.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The wonderful current?! - OG}The mystery current?!{Gab, 26:38}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.61,0:27:06.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is it? Where is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.04,0:27:07.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.65,0:27:10.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.65,0:27:14.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's the downward current!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.08,0:27:16.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The downward flow–plume! - OG}The Downwelling Current Plume!{Gab, term stolen from viz}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.49,0:27:20.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How... cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.46,0:27:23.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like a massive...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.83,0:27:29.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,waterfall in the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.63,0:27:32.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sea is "falling" far below!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.23,0:27:35.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At an extraordinary speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.14,0:27:36.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.04,0:27:41.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Nature's great! - CR}Nature is awesome!{Z - the current line read like an incomplete thought}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.48,0:27:43.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a spectacular stream!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.65,0:27:46.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder how deep it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.55,0:27:50.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's far greater than I had heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.19,0:27:53.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't see the bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.09,0:27:54.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's completely dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.36,0:27:56.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.79,0:28:01.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{With that speed, we're gonna be\Nslammed into the bottom and die! - CR}At that speed, we'd slam\Ninto the bottom and die!{Z - passive voice removal}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.06,0:28:05.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it really okay to go with the flow?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.07,0:28:07.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.24,0:28:12.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sunny{\i0} is the strongest ship\Nbuilt from Adam, the Jewel Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.81,0:28:16.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.05,0:28:21.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that it lives here...!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.58,0:28:24.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a demon that rules the realm of water!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.09,0:28:27.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the enemy of the human race!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.99,0:28:31.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.19,0:28:32.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should turn back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.86,0:28:34.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.66,0:28:36.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had forgotten about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.47,0:28:38.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.24,0:28:40.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.97,0:28:41.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's right there...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.84,0:28:44.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cut it out, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.11,0:28:46.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Behind you...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.64,0:28:48.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.58,0:28:52.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Be... - OG}Is it...{Gab, would look like just the word "be" if its split but with the same wording}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.92,0:28:55.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.39,0:29:05.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the kraken!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.63,0:29:08.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How huge! The monster octopus!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.63,0:29:12.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like he broke a lot of ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.80,0:29:15.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ships that had left for\Nthe New World have been attacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.04,0:29:19.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please! I don't wanna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.04,0:29:20.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.24,0:29:23.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you just wait for a few days, it would–
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.78,0:29:25.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.82,0:29:29.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have a good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.05,0:29:32.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's tame him!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.82,0:29:33.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Huh?\N– Huh?
